<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 24-MAR.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 24-MAR.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone Justin is now east of Australia near 20s/148e, moving east southeast at 10 mph. Top winds are 50 mph, but will weaken this period as the storm moves out to sea, threatening only shipping. Justin will dissipate within 48 hours.  </p>
<p>There are no further emergency statements at this time.</p>
</text>
